{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/3aaf4c339fa71ea9dc8872a00818a0a4.poster.avif?t=1763437954\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/3aaf4c339fa71ea9dc8872a00818a0a4.webm?t=1763437954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/3aaf4c339fa71ea9dc8872a00818a0a4.mp4?t=1763437954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astrochibbi Conquest</strong> is a fast-paced arena survivor with a cosmic chibbi twist. Take control of your tiny astro and face endless swarms of enemies in chaotic bullet-hell battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/extras/0928a304aa143b3fbf7eade57ef4795f.avif?t=1763437954\" width=1560 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect weapons, stack upgrades, and discover powerful combos as you fight to last longer each run. Survive the waves, chase high scores, and carve out your place on a forgotten planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045360?t=1763437954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/68070ac78e136e4d96389f87a283bad5ce4c0b44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763437954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045360/eb962e25919b5b7a148e42462e7ac2b7700bcffd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763437954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap